# Built by make; but the hard disk and clock cards' firmware, which the
# emulator has built in
*.bin
!hard_disk.bin
!clock.bin
*.o
*.map
*.lbl
# ROM dumps of real machines: their makers', not part of the repository
*.rom
apple2/*.zip
# Disk images of real software: their makers', likewise
*.dsk
*.do
*.po
*.nib
*.woz
*.d13
*.fds
# The disks folder: images, and what comes with them
apple2/disks/
# Save states, beside the disk or ROM they're of
*.state
# NES ROMs, games' and the test ROMs' (roms/nes/tests/, their own
# collections)
*.nes
nes/tests/
# Atari 2600 ROMs, likewise
*.a26
# Atari 7800 ROMs, likewise
*.a78
7800/*.zip
# Skink's boot image and disk, GeckOS's, as its "make install" puts them
skink/
